casebook c-46cfr-63_15-7-and-63_25-1-boiler-draft v1
source "C-46cfr-63.15-7-and-63.25-1-boiler.txt" dated 2026-10-14 by "drafted by anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5 from the manual; not yet approved"
note "UNAPPROVED DRAFT: written by a language model from C-46cfr-63.15-7-and-63.25-1-boiler.txt. Every declaration below cites the sentence"
note "it came from. Check each against the manual, add what the manual does not say, then delete"
note "this note to approve. quorum studio will not build a chip image while it is here."

# manual: "An audible alarm must automatically sound when a flame safety system shutdown occurs."
observe flame_safety_shutdown "a flame safety system shutdown has occurred"

# manual: "For steam boilers, operation of the lower low water cutoff must automatically sound an audible alarm."
observe lower_low_water_cutoff_operated "the lower low water cutoff has operated on a steam boiler"

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
observe prepurge_done "the prepurge period of at least four air changes and not less than 15 seconds has finished"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe start_requested "ignition occurring in the combustion chamber"

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers must be equipped with a visual indicator which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated."
observe low_water_cutoff_activated "the low water cutoff of a small automatic auxiliary boiler has activated"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe fuel_oil_valve_opening "the fuel oil valve is opening"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe ignition_established "ignition has occurred"

# manual: "An audible alarm must automatically sound when a flame safety system shutdown occurs."
claim flame_safety_trip "boiler shut down by the flame safety system" severity 6 needs flame_safety_shutdown

# manual: "A visual indicator must indicate that the shutdown was caused by low water."
claim low_water_trip "boiler shut down because of low water" severity 7 needs lower_low_water_cutoff_operated

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
claim start_too_soon "starting now would skip the required prepurge" severity 5 needs start_requested

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers must be equipped with a visual indicator which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated."
claim small_boiler_low_water_cutoff "low water cutoff has activated on a small automatic auxiliary boiler and must be visually indicated" severity 6 needs low_water_cutoff_activated

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
claim fuel_before_ignition "fuel oil valve opening without ignition before or at the same time" severity 6 needs fuel_oil_valve_opening

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
prepurge_done rebuts start_too_soon

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
ignition_established rebuts fuel_before_ignition

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
action hold_start when any start_too_soon

# manual: "Means must be provided to silence the audible alarm."
action keep_running idle

# manual: "A visual indicator must indicate that the shutdown was caused by low water."
action shutdown_boiler safe when any low_water_trip

# manual: "An audible alarm must automatically sound when a flame safety system shutdown occurs."
action raise_alarm when any flame_safety_trip low_water_trip

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers must be equipped with a visual indicator which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated."
action show_low_water_indicator when any small_boiler_low_water_cutoff

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
action hold_fuel_valve when any fuel_before_ignition

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
prefer shutdown_boiler over hold_fuel_valve over hold_start over raise_alarm over show_low_water_indicator over keep_running
